error BYN1053: `Shape` declares its cases on one line; write one per line

  1 │ union Shape { circle(f64 r), square(f64 side) }
    │                            ^ the first `,`
    │
  help: write each case on its own line
    │ 1 │ union Shape {
    │ 2 │     circle(f64 r)
    │   │ +++++++++++++++++
    │ 3 │     square(f64 side)
    │   │ ++++++++++++++++++++
